{"c":[{"name":"20261018T211547Z-7e6ede0556b999df","text":"Engine suite from a git-archive copy (empty .git marker): test_reuse_lint_passes fails whenever make coverage-engine's sync has created the copy's skills/sr-search/.venv first; git init plus git add -A in the copy avoids it.","type":"note"},{"name":"20261020T175250Z-aa5758b35ed49d8e","text":"semantic and embed exit 1 with one torch line: ensure-env when a usable freeze exists, else the quoted pip line; an encoder failure after import says re-run sr-initialize, not ensure-env.","type":"note"}]}
